          },
          "author": "Slumberkins",
          "description": "It’s never too early to teach children about mindfulness! Whether your kids are at home, on the go, or at school, these mini meditations are an easy way to get children to calm their active bodies alongside creatures travelling through space. Each meditation was developed by therapists and educators at Slumberkins, the leading brand for early emotional learning.   \n\nThis series of Mini Meditations includes:   \n• Following Curiosity with Dragon \n• Boosting Heart Confidence with Bigfoot \n• Connecting with Communication with Lynx \n• Facing Challenges with Hammerhead",
